{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss Segoe UI;}}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa120\f0\fs17 {\b Zentriq License Server}\par Internal software of Zentriq for issuing and validating Zentriq licenses. For use by Zentriq and its authorised staff only; do not give it to customers.\par {\b What this setup installs}\par - The license server and its license portal (Windows service "Zentriq License Server").\par - PostgreSQL 17 (EnterpriseDB binaries) as its own database service "Zentriq License Server database", reachable from this computer only.\par After the installation the setup wizard opens in the browser (http://localhost:5080/setup): owner account, signing key, key backup, and who can reach the server.\par {\b Your data}\par The database, the signing key, certificates and backups are kept in C:\\ProgramData\\Zentriq\\LicenseServer and are not removed when the program is uninstalled.\par {\b Third-party software}\par PostgreSQL is released under the PostgreSQL License; its full text is installed with it (C:\\Program Files\\Zentriq License Server\\pgsql\\COPYRIGHT).\par .NET and ASP.NET Core are released under the MIT License (Copyright (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors). LettuceEncrypt is released under the Apache License 2.0.\par }
